"/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids came in under 90% of normal in November to December in 44 of 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025 the middle ran 47% of normal in April to May and 164% in August to September. So far in 2026 the middle shows 8% of normal for February to March and 26% for March to April. Grid 24118 had its driest year in 2022 at 50%.</p>"}
